Build into tmp/mgba/ads-hooks/ (or set ADS_CORE).
mGBA libretro core patch for the ADS tools (MPL-2.0, as mGBA). Apply to the nixpkgs libretro.mgba
source, then: make -f Makefile.libretro. Adds: synchronous PC hooks (retro_bp_* + retro_bp_cb) used by
capture.py, a cycle-weighted PC histogram (retro_prof_*, from the GBA Video triage), and 16 PC-bucket
cycle/instruction counters (retro_bk_*) used by perf.py. All symbols are exported through link.T (retro_*).

